d access to the resolved interpreter path and its prefix (walk argv[0]/sys.prefix of the payload? not knowable in a bash wrapper) — practical minimum: add common toolchain roots (~/.venvs, ~/tools, ~/venvs, ~/sdkman, ~/.pyenv, ~/miniconda*, ~/mambaforge) to _HOME_READ, and/or emit a loud wrapper warning when the payload interpreter resolves outside the granted set so the Errno 13 is diagnosable.","found_by":"terminal-jail-qa tick terminal-jail-qa-2026-10-10-09-05-36 (bunker battery, agent ccc77793)","ts":"2026-10-10T09:45:00Z"}
